      "text": "(C Library)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(C Library)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LTZ-IHooVPUj6VfTSUI5N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22090.728809366472,
      "y": 18348.606968369946,
      "width": 1472.89892578125,
      "height": 225.39396499565225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bnw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1255963390,
      "version": 530,
      "versionNonce": 142779234,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787076602215,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Your chip8.cpp interpreter logic only produces abstract state — a 64×32 array of on/off pixels, \na record of which of the 16 keys are currently pressed, a sound timer counting down. None of that \nis inherently visible or interactive on its own; it's just numbers sitting in memory. SDL is what turns:\n\nyour pixel buffer → an actual window with pixels drawn on screen\nphysical keyboard presses → updates to your keypad state array\nyour sound timer being nonzero → an actual audible beep",
      "fontSize": 25.7593102852174,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Your chip8.cpp interpreter logic only produces abstract state — a 64×32 array of on/off pixels, \na record of which of the 16 keys are currently pressed, a sound timer counting down. None of that \nis inherently visible or interactive on its own; it's just numbers sitting in memory. SDL is what turns:\n\nyour pixel buffer → an actual window with pixels drawn on screen\nphysical keyboard presses → updates to your keypad state array\nyour sound timer being nonzero → an actual audible beep",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
