      "versionNonce": 1711111522,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787077845966,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NNN: The second, third and fourth nibbles. A 12-bit immediate memory\naddress",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NNN: The second, third and fourth nibbles. A 12-bit immediate memory address",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Dx5vimtv4MFzO3tz2gcQo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22797.3241538438,
      "y": 17640.269507207344,
      "width": 748,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bp2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1321842722,
      "version": 108,
      "versionNonce": 1393057378,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787078923326,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Configure — CMake reads CMakeLists.txt and (re)generates the\n.sln/.vcxproj files in build/. You only need to re-run this when\nCMakeLists.txt itself changes (e.g., you add a new source file to\nadd_executable(...), add a new dependency like SDL2, change compiler\nsettings).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Configure — CMake reads CMakeLists.txt and (re)generates the .sln/.vcxproj files in build/. You only need to re-run this when CMakeLists.txt itself changes (e.g., you add a new source file to add_executable(...), add a new dependency like SDL2, change compiler settings).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NuKh1XAEiWtHgklt8gEET",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22794.37506461557,
      "y": 17778.73556669283,
      "width": 781,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bp3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 635884286,
      "version": 150,
      "versionNonce": 1057466530,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787078932327,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Build — actually invokes the compiler/linker (MSBuild, in your case) to\ncompile changed .cpp files and relink the executable. You need this\nevery time you change any .cpp/.h file, not just new ones — including\nedits to existing files.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Build — actually invokes the compiler/linker (MSBuild, in your case) to compile changed .cpp files and relink the executable. You need this every time you change any .cpp/.h file, not just new ones — including edits to existing files.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
